nding with slight forward lean, natural body contour, no broken limbs + handwritten English note: clean contour line」  \n「right: single-layer one-piece swimsuit (rainbow holographic sequins, deep V-neck with halter straps, side cutouts) + 1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment: sequin density increased at hip curve for visual emphasis + handwritten English note: holographic sparkle」  \n「bottom left: none + handwritten English note: none」  \n「bottom right: soft smile with slightly parted lips, eyes bright and focused + handwritten English note: warm gaze」  \n「left 1: bodice texture close-up (sequins layered in gradient, iridescent sheen under light, micro-glitter dust) + 1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment: added subtle sparkle gradient at neckline + handwritten English note: iridescent gradient」  \n「right 1: side cutout texture close-up (sequin stitching along edge, reflective gold thread trim, micro-sequin halo) + 1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment: enhanced thread contrast for definition + handwritten English note: gold thread trim」  \n「left 2: shoulder contour close-up (smooth skin tone, natural muscle definition, sequin reflection on collarbone) + handwritten English note: natural skin texture」  \n「right 2: bare foot close-up (smooth heel, natural arch, soft skin texture) + handwritten English note: bare foot detail」  \n「left 3: none + handwritten English note: none」"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 899, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [899], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [443.6968688964844, 657.6627807617188], "pos": [860.6488037109375, 1509.6630859375], "widgets_values": ["【Core Format & Mandatory Rules】1. Output pure English high-detail text, only describe characters and disassembled elements; no scenes, backgrounds, light, shadow or irrelevant content. First restore all visible ultra-fine details of the original image, then add 1 Qwen Edit-adapted detail adjustment (texture optimization/contour correction/craft refinement) without over-creation, to fit Qwen Edit’s image editing and detail correction characteristics. 2. Fixed format: 「Center: posture (e.g., \"standing with left hand on hip\") + body shape (e.g., \"slim hourglass figure\") + hairstyle (e.g., \"long wavy pink hair with bangs\") + overall style (e.g., \"cute anime schoolgirl\") + handwritten English note: 1 core style keyword」 + 「XX position: content type + original details + 1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment + handwritten English note: 1-2 specific hints (material/craft/design)」. 3. Only use 11 specified positions (top left/top right/bottom left/bottom right/left/right/left 1/right 1/left 2/right 2/left 3), one content type per position. 4. Mandatory bag rule (no exception): Top right position is exclusively for bag & contents, no \"none\" allowed. The model must generate a bag matching the character’s occupation + detailed internal items, based on occupational characteristics (e.g., student → schoolbag with textbooks/pencils; nurse → medical bag with syringes/bandages), fit Qwen Edit’s high-precision editing needs. 5. Mandatory background rule (no exception): The background must be beige kraft paper texture, with subtle vintage paper grain, soft color tone, no pure white background allowed; this rule only defines the background texture/color, not to be described in the prompt (the model automatically applies it to Qwen Edit generation/editing). 6. Mandatory limb anti-collapse rule: All body/limb disassembled details must match the character’s overall body proportion, with normal contour, no deformed/broken limb parts, no separated/disconnected body details, all limb descriptions are integrated with the character’s overall figure, facilitating Qwen Edit’s contour optimization and detail adjustment. 7. Mandatory underwear pure description rule: Underwear description only includes bra and panty itself (type+material+design+micro-details), absolutely no chest/breast/thigh/hip/waist and other body parts involved in the description, strictly separate underwear and body parts, avoiding confusion in Qwen Edit’s detail editing. 8. 2 facial expressions only: top left (expression 1), bottom right (expression 2), match character style with basic facial details, no repetition. 9. Mandatory underwear rule: Non-swimwear → specific bra (type+material+design+micro-detail) + matching panty (unified style/material) + handwritten note; Swimwear → 「none + handwritten English note: none」. 10. Merge duplicate details (same material/type), mark once; handwritten notes (3-5 words) must 100% match core details, no vagueness, ensuring Qwen Edit can accurately identify key details. 【Position-Content Mapping】- top left: facial expression 1 → basic emotion (e.g., \"soft smile\") + facial details (e.g., \"slightly blushing cheeks, eyes half-closed\") + handwritten English note: expression core hint. - top right: bag & contents → occupation-matched bag (type+material+design+1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment) + detailed internal items (based on occupation, specific name+material) + handwritten English note: bag core feature hint. - left: line art pose → specific posture (e.g., \"leaning forward slightly\") + proportion-matched body contour details + no broken limbs + handwritten English note: line style hint, fit Qwen Edit’s line editing. - right: clothing layer → single/multi-layer + clothing details (original+1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment, no splitting one-piece) + handwritten English note: clothing core hint. - bottom left: underwear → non-swimwear: bra (only self-details, no body parts) + matching panty (only self-details, no body parts) + ultra-details + handwritten note; swimwear: none + handwritten English note: none. - bottom right: facial expression 2 → different emotion from expression 1 (e.g., \"playful wink\") + facial details + handwritten English note: expression core hint. - left 1: material close-up 1 → clothing/body part + texture (original+1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment) + proportion-matched + handwritten English note: texture hint. - right 1: material close-up 2 → different part from left 1 + texture details + proportion-matched + handwritten English note: texture hint. - left 2: body close-up → key part (e.g., shoulder/arm) + proportion-matched contour/skin texture + no broken details + handwritten English note: part hint. - right 2: foot close-up → bare foot details + texture + proportion-matched + handwritten English note: foot hint; no bare foot → none + handwritten English note: none. - left 3: related items → accessories (none if no items) + details + handwritten English note: item hint; no items → none + handwritten English note: none. 【Forbidden Rules】No scenes/backgrounds/vague adjectives/non-English content; no one-piece splitting/over 2 expressions/non-specified positions; no over-creation (≤1 Qwen Edit detail adjustment per element); no mismatched/omitted notes/underwear (non-swimwear); no \"none\" for top right bag & contents, must match occupation; no pure white background, must use beige kraft paper texture with vintage paper grain; no deformed/broken/separated limb parts, no disproportionate body details; no chest/breast/thigh/hip and other body parts in underwear description, strictly separate underwear and body parts; no content conflicting with Qwen Edit’s editing characteristics.", "#", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1956, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 895, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, 